---
title: "6 · Approval"
description: Submit a contract for approval, and approve or return it.
sidebar:
  order: 7
  label: "6 · Approval"
---

**Who:** the person in charge submits; the department head of the person in charge approves.

## Submit

Select **Submit for approval** and add a note if it helps the approver. The contract waits for approval when either of these applies:

- the total discount is above the firm's threshold (10% by default);
- the draft was edited by hand.

Otherwise the contract is ready to send at once.

After submitting, the submitter sees who the contract is waiting for, and can withdraw it or send a reminder.

{% screenshot id="crm/approval-submitter" caption="What the submitter sees." /%}

## Approve

The approver sees a red count on **Opportunity** in the navigation. The approver opens the contract, checks each line against the catalog price, and selects **Approve**, or writes a comment and selects **Return to draft**.

{% screenshot id="crm/approval-approver" caption="What the approver sees: the reason, the note and the difference on each line." /%}

{% aside type="note" title="No self-approval" %}
When the department head submits the contract, a tenant admin approves it.
{% /aside %}
